          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പിരിക്കുക (pirikkuka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 4176 lists Malayalam pirikka, \"to sever, to dismiss\". DEDR does not list the sense \"to collect dues\"."
            }
          ]
        },
